# The Docker build context is the repository root — Railway's config-as-code
# does not follow Root Directory, so every Dockerfile here builds from the root
# and would otherwise upload the whole workspace to the builder.
#
# `apps/rembg` copies two files. Everything below is weight nothing needs, and
# `node_modules` alone is several gigabytes of it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Never into an image, even one that does not read them.
.env
.env.local
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Large working artefacts that are not application code.
packages/engine/harness/out
products
docs
.claude
